.TH "TODOPRO DATA EXPORT" "1" "2026-10-13" "1.0.0" "todopro data export Manual"
.SH NAME
todopro\-data\-export \- Export your data.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B todopro data export
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Export your data.
.PP
By default this exports tasks, projects, labels and contexts as JSON.
Use --archive for the *complete* export (every record group plus your
uploaded attachments) as a ZIP — this is the one to use for a genuine
data-portability / GDPR copy of your account.
.PP
Examples:
    todopro data export
    todopro data export --output backup.json
    todopro data export --compress
    todopro data export --archive --output my-todopro-data.zip
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-o,\fP \-\-output TEXT
Output file path (default: todopro-export-{timestamp}.json)
.TP
\fB\-z,\fP \-\-compress
Compress output with gzip
.TP
\fB\-a,\fP \-\-archive
Complete export: a ZIP with data.json plus your uploaded attachments (remote contexts only). Generated server-side.
.TP
\fB\-\-timeout\fP INTEGER
Seconds to wait for an --archive export to finish  [default: 600]
